+---/*
|   +---!
|   +--- @function getClassSize
|   +---
@abstract 'Get'ter for sizeof(class).
|   +---
@result sizeof of class that this OSMetaClass instance represents. 
|   +---*/
+---[ NEWLINE ]
+---    
+-*-unsigned (HAS STATE)
