|   +---OSMetaClass
|   +--- 
|   +---*
|   +---inSuperClass
|   +---,
|   +---[ NEWLINE ]
|   +---                
|   +---unsigned
|   +--- 
|   +---int
|   +--- 
|   +---inClassSize
|   +---)
+---;
