OBJECT: ~OSMetaClass (HeaderDoc::Function)
+-*-virtual (HAS STATE)
+--- 
+---~
+---OSMetaClass
+---(
|   +---)
+---;
+--- 
-=-=-=-=-=-=- EODEC -=-=-=-=-=-=-
+---[ NEWLINE ]
+---[ NEWLINE ]
+---    
+---//
|   +--- 
|   +---Needs to be overriden as NULL as all OSMetaClass objects are allocated
|   +---[ NEWLINE ]
+---    
+---//
|   +--- 
|   +---statically at compile time, don't accidently try to free them.
|   +---[ NEWLINE ]
+---    
+-*-void (HAS STATE)
+--- 
+---operator
+--- 
+---delete
+---(
|   +---void
|   +--- 
|   +---*
