+---[ NEWLINE ]
+---[ NEWLINE ]
+---/*
|   +---!
|   +--- @function checkMetaCast
|   +---
@abstract Ask a OSMetaClass instance if the given object is either an instance of it or an instance of a subclass of it.
|   +---
@param check Pointer of object to introspect.
|   +---
