|   +---
@param check Pointer of object to introspect.
|   +---
@result check parameter if cast valid, 0 otherwise. 
|   +---*/
+---[ NEWLINE ]
+---    
+-*-OSMetaClassBase (HAS STATE)
+--- 
+---*
